WEBVTT

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:15.560
<i>This is Kyou, my elder daughter.</i>

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:19.660
<i>She’s fifteen years old.</i>

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:28.240
<i>This one is Asu, my younger daughter.</i>

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:30.240
<i>She’s only nine years old.</i>

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:38.360
<i>To ensure that she doesn’t wake her sister, Kyou
always gets up quickly when the alarm clock rings.</i>

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:51.530
<i>Every morning, Kyou leaves to deliver newspapers.</i>

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.200
I’ll be going now.

00:00:57.680 --> 00:00:58.670
All right!

00:01:02.990 --> 00:01:06.580
<i>Good morning, Asu. I can’t wait for today’s fireworks festival!{festival?}</i>

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:16.160
<i>I’ve always been watching over
the two of them from heaven.{this is hella clunk}</i>

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:22.970
<i>I was able to leave behind just
one thing for the two of you:</i>

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:26.750
<i>a small promise.</i>

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:46.070
Mom went to heaven the year Asu was born.

00:01:46.570 --> 00:01:49.730
Dad disappeared after accumulating gambling debts.

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:54.010
Thus, we were abandoned.

00:01:54.730 --> 00:01:58.840
This is a 40-year-old, one-room,
dilapidated apartment with no bath.

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:00.930
This is our home.

00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:03.590
But, when spring comes…

